SITUATION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The Cloud Sandbox environment where Claude runs has a network sandbox
that blocks:
  ✗ SSH authentication (ssh command unavailable)
  ✗ HTTPS with user prompts (terminal I/O disabled)
  ✗ GitHub CLI authentication
  ✗ Direct API authentication without PAT

This is an INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITATION, not a code/implementation issue.

